# Docs screenshot: the Terrain Tiles window (docs/editor/terrain-tiles.md, #45).
wait 8
key escape
click @menu:View
click @menu:View/Workspaces
click @menu:Workspaces/Animation
wait 3
key escape
key ctrl+a
type tile map
key enter
wait 2
click @tile.tileset
click @pick:textures/Tiles.png
wait 2
click @tile.layer:Terrains
click @tile.terrain-new
click @tile.terrain-edit:0
wait 2
click @terrain.pattern:46
click @terrain.tile:26
click @terrain.pattern:0
click @terrain.tile:1
wait 2
annotate @terrain.advance Next pattern after a pick
annotate @terrain.pattern:0 A pattern: click it, then its tiles
annotate @terrain.tile:1 The tileset: click to add or remove a tile
annotate @terrain.done Done (saved as you pick)
screenshot editor_terrain-tiles
key f1
expect noderef.page == editor/terrain-tiles
